(3437006, 477644, 66635, '<td valign="top">Chris:<br/>I think you''ve nailed this one with one of the best pictures here.  Granted, I haven''t looked at any of the others except in the small form, but a lot of them look like they''re really stretching to fit the challenge.  Yours is awesome.  Not sure what final score I''ll give you until I''ve seen all the others.  But, I''m going to score you pretty high.</td>', 'Chris:I think you''ve nailed this one with one of the best pictures here.  Granted, I haven''t looked at any of the others except in the small form, but a lot of them look like they''re really stretching to fit the challenge.  Yours is awesome.  Not sure what final score I''ll give you until I''ve seen all the others.  But, I''m going to score you pretty high.', '2007-03-07 08:47:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(3437027, 479981, 66635, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and good idea, but the picture does not appear centered (i.e., there''s more wall on the right than on the left.  Maybe you intended it that way.  Maybe I''m too left brained.</td>', 'Nice lighting and good idea, but the picture does not appear centered (i.e., there''s more wall on the right than on the left.  Maybe you intended it that way.  Maybe I''m too left brained.', '2007-03-07 08:52:13.000000', NULL, 1),
