(3438173, 480151, 63812, '<td valign="top">i like this ...</td>', 'i like this ...', '2007-03-07 12:51:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3438174, 479905, 68648, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, but the composition doesn''t work as well as it could.  Just lining things up like that leaves the image dimensionless.  I would''ve moved the pie &amp; pie-caddy off to one side and rotated the handle about 45-degrees, the taller items (especially the Southern Comfort bottle) should be moved to the back of the line-up -- or, even, to a less "obvious" spot like on the rear counter for the viewer to "discover".  Finally, what it the purpose of the napkins or dish-towels (under the lemon and the pie)????  Perhaps they could be removed altogether.  I do like the lighting, although because it is incandescent, it is a bit "yellow"</td>', 'Interesting idea, but the composition doesn''t work as well as it could.  Just lining things up like that leaves the image dimensionless.  I would''ve moved the pie & pie-caddy off to one side and rotated the handle about 45-degrees, the taller items (especially the Southern Comfort bottle) should be moved to the back of the line-up -- or, even, to a less "obvious" spot like on the rear counter for the viewer to "discover".  Finally, what it the purpose of the napkins or dish-towels (under the lemon and the pie)????  Perhaps they could be removed altogether.  I do like the lighting, although because it is incandescent, it is a bit "yellow"', '2007-03-07 12:52:09.000000', NULL, 1),
