(3438212, 480010, 74015, '<td valign="top">Your concept is good, the composition is too but, in my opinion, the overexposure detracts from what would have been a great shot.  The colors look a bit washed out because of it.  Having the wheatgrass tray diagonally across the frame would have jazzed it up a bit too.  On another note, do you really drink that stuff??</td>', 'Your concept is good, the composition is too but, in my opinion, the overexposure detracts from what would have been a great shot.  The colors look a bit washed out because of it.  Having the wheatgrass tray diagonally across the frame would have jazzed it up a bit too.  On another note, do you really drink that stuff??', '2007-03-07 12:58:55.000000', NULL, 1),
