(3439943, 480175, 66524, '<td valign="top">I had to google to understand that <b>Ribes nigrum </b>was a European Blackcurrent.  Now that I understand the concept, I appreciate the lovely cut glass filled with, what I thought was wine - nice clarity.  In any case, I thought the photo could have held on its own merit without the pills, but then I considered a juxtoposition concept (?). What bothers me are the white spots in the shadow areas - still a nice concept.</td>', 'I had to google to understand that Ribes nigrum was a European Blackcurrent.  Now that I understand the concept, I appreciate the lovely cut glass filled with, what I thought was wine - nice clarity.  In any case, I thought the photo could have held on its own merit without the pills, but then I considered a juxtoposition concept (?). What bothers me are the white spots in the shadow areas - still a nice concept.', '2007-03-07 18:40:49.000000', NULL, 1),
