(3442915, 479875, 40718, '<td valign="top">likely means much more to the photographer than the general public.  what a little redhead.  The flash probably ruins this for me.  leads to bleached faces and dark shadows behind. 4</td>', 'likely means much more to the photographer than the general public.  what a little redhead.  The flash probably ruins this for me.  leads to bleached faces and dark shadows behind. 4', '2007-03-08 11:31:59.000000', NULL, 1),
