(3442928, 480498, 40718, '<td valign="top">ok, I''m not busting you for the homeopathy (I promise).  The shot is not bad.  I do like the pattern presented.  I''m plus/minus over the high contrast approach.  I can''t decide if it works or not. 6</td>', 'ok, I''m not busting you for the homeopathy (I promise).  The shot is not bad.  I do like the pattern presented.  I''m plus/minus over the high contrast approach.  I can''t decide if it works or not. 6', '2007-03-08 11:34:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3442942, 480151, 31443, '<td valign="top">That look on his face is priceless!</td>', 'That look on his face is priceless!', '2007-03-08 11:39:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3442943, 479209, 40718, '<td valign="top">I sorta like this abstract, but the title ruins it for me because I''m left trying to bring it into the shot.  I can''t do it.  I''m gonna take this just as an abstract and forget about the DNMC part. 6</td>', 'I sorta like this abstract, but the title ruins it for me because I''m left trying to bring it into the shot.  I can''t do it.  I''m gonna take this just as an abstract and forget about the DNMC part. 6', '2007-03-08 11:40:23.000000', NULL, 1),
