(3444123, 480191, 66524, '<td valign="top">The concept is very creative and I admire that you offered a unique point of view to the challenge.  I did not know what Viridian Method was until I Googled it...before that I thought it was a shade of green.<br/> <br/>I think you could have spent some time thinking about how to visualize your concept in a photographic sense that would appeal to the viewers emotion - but then, it''s not a common theme; you had a real struggle to show this theme.  IMHO it turned out to be more of a "snap shot photo" than a well thought out interpretation of <b>Alternative Medicine</b>.  Additionally, I don''t like to vote down a creative approach because the photo wasn''t slick and sexy like so many we compete against...5</td>', 'The concept is very creative and I admire that you offered a unique point of view to the challenge.  I did not know what Viridian Method was until I Googled it...before that I thought it was a shade of green. I think you could have spent some time thinking about how to visualize your concept in a photographic sense that would appeal to the viewers emotion - but then, it''s not a common theme; you had a real struggle to show this theme.  IMHO it turned out to be more of a "snap shot photo" than a well thought out interpretation of Alternative Medicine.  Additionally, I don''t like to vote down a creative approach because the photo wasn''t slick and sexy like so many we compete against...5', '2007-03-08 17:45:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3444153, 480321, 66524, '<td valign="top">S.A.D. is a great theme.  IMHO, I could vote higher if the skiers took time to view their surroundings by removing their goggles to appreciate more of the outdoors.  This seems to be more of a "snap shot" you happened to take within the challenge time frame - still it is apparent you are thinking about the challenge themes.  Take the time to <i>set up </i>your interpretation of the themes presented @ DPC. ---&gt; 5</td>', 'S.A.D. is a great theme.  IMHO, I could vote higher if the skiers took time to view their surroundings by removing their goggles to appreciate more of the outdoors.  This seems to be more of a "snap shot" you happened to take within the challenge time frame - still it is apparent you are thinking about the challenge themes.  Take the time to set up your interpretation of the themes presented @ DPC. ---> 5', '2007-03-08 17:54:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3444162, 480109, 66524, '<td valign="top">At first I thought this was an attempt to <i>sneak</i> a nice landscape into the challenge, but when I think about it...giving pause to appreciate the beauty of the sun, is indeed alternative medicine.  Thank you for sharing this interpretation.</td>', 'At first I thought this was an attempt to sneak a nice landscape into the challenge, but when I think about it...giving pause to appreciate the beauty of the sun, is indeed alternative medicine.  Thank you for sharing this interpretation.', '2007-03-08 17:59:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(3444209, 480498, 66524, '<td valign="top">Your entry to the "Alternative Medicine" challenge strikes me as being too stark and the repetition of the bottles (all in the same manner and direction) suggests a feeling of regimentation.  IMHO this contradicts with the theme of alternatine medicine for healing properties.  Then again you might have shot for a juxtaposition of the themes intent?...but your title does not suggest that. --&gt; 5</td>', 'Your entry to the "Alternative Medicine" challenge strikes me as being too stark and the repetition of the bottles (all in the same manner and direction) suggests a feeling of regimentation.  IMHO this contradicts with the theme of alternatine medicine for healing properties.  Then again you might have shot for a juxtaposition of the themes intent?...but your title does not suggest that. --> 5', '2007-03-08 18:28:03.000000', NULL, 1),
