(3447835, 480328, 70000, '<td valign="top">Nice, I love reflexology, The lighting here is nice and the depth of field really makes the foot pop out.</td>', 'Nice, I love reflexology, The lighting here is nice and the depth of field really makes the foot pop out.', '2007-03-10 00:20:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(3447836, 480442, 19831, '<td valign="top">This is a real cute idea. I actually like woody shots. Technically, this is pretty good. Compositionally, it seems a little static, with him just lying there, centered. Perhaps more of a diagonal could be a little more dynamic? I am also thinking, that maybe instead of the very nice, even lighting, some shadows and such, setting a little ''darker'' mood, tying in the ''voodoo'' theme more? Maybe not, that might just be me :-)</td>', 'This is a real cute idea. I actually like woody shots. Technically, this is pretty good. Compositionally, it seems a little static, with him just lying there, centered. Perhaps more of a diagonal could be a little more dynamic? I am also thinking, that maybe instead of the very nice, even lighting, some shadows and such, setting a little ''darker'' mood, tying in the ''voodoo'' theme more? Maybe not, that might just be me :-)', '2007-03-10 00:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3447838, 479328, 70000, '<td valign="top">I like what you ahve done here but the lighting seems a bit flat. Maybe a bit more contrast on his skin and in his hair would help.</td>', 'I like what you ahve done here but the lighting seems a bit flat. Maybe a bit more contrast on his skin and in his hair would help.', '2007-03-10 00:21:12.000000', NULL, 1),
