(3447847, 478619, 70000, '<td valign="top">This is interesting what you have done here but the lighting and iffy focus really make what you are trying to show not obvious, the bright light on the curtain in the back really draws your attention away from the bandades and needles.</td>', 'This is interesting what you have done here but the lighting and iffy focus really make what you are trying to show not obvious, the bright light on the curtain in the back really draws your attention away from the bandades and needles.', '2007-03-10 00:24:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(3447852, 479209, 19831, '<td valign="top">Ah, a daring entry! I''m a sucker for abstracts. It is unfortunate that there seems to not be a lot of folks that can appreciate the genre. I really like the warm tones here. The blackness at the left edge of frame I believe works well, adding a little weight and direction to the composition. I''m left wishing there were just a touch more feeling of motion, or flow in the shot, but still a good score from me. Nice job.</td>', 'Ah, a daring entry! I''m a sucker for abstracts. It is unfortunate that there seems to not be a lot of folks that can appreciate the genre. I really like the warm tones here. The blackness at the left edge of frame I believe works well, adding a little weight and direction to the composition. I''m left wishing there were just a touch more feeling of motion, or flow in the shot, but still a good score from me. Nice job.', '2007-03-10 00:30:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3447863, 480541, 19831, '<td valign="top">Good setup, and a very cool image. Nice job!</td>', 'Good setup, and a very cool image. Nice job!', '2007-03-10 00:39:56.000000', NULL, 1),
