(3448998, 480063, 37104, '<td valign="top">I think that this is a little too much of a stretch for the challenge. That aside, the picture looks too washed out to me. The colors are all a bit dull and boring, making a shot that isn''t dynamic and thus not as interesting. The composition is pretty good. I wish that the flowers were not so overbearing in the composition.</td>', 'I think that this is a little too much of a stretch for the challenge. That aside, the picture looks too washed out to me. The colors are all a bit dull and boring, making a shot that isn''t dynamic and thus not as interesting. The composition is pretty good. I wish that the flowers were not so overbearing in the composition.', '2007-03-10 15:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
