(3450460, 480149, 16197, '<td valign="top">looks like some seriously dried garlic.  I think the carrot looks great but could use a bit more pop on the colour, or maybe a stronger dof.  The concept is fun, but don''t think I understand why the needle tip is discoloured?  Nice colour choices and comp.</td>', 'looks like some seriously dried garlic.  I think the carrot looks great but could use a bit more pop on the colour, or maybe a stronger dof.  The concept is fun, but don''t think I understand why the needle tip is discoloured?  Nice colour choices and comp.', '2007-03-11 14:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
