(3450504, 478851, 16197, '<td valign="top">I like the concept, however, the image is very small and the light itself really takes away from the effect the rest of the image can have.  I would love to see a more advanced edit on this image.  Maybe masking out the light so it is not so bright, and adding a bit more brightness to the glass/bottle/cork/doelly.</td>', 'I like the concept, however, the image is very small and the light itself really takes away from the effect the rest of the image can have.  I would love to see a more advanced edit on this image.  Maybe masking out the light so it is not so bright, and adding a bit more brightness to the glass/bottle/cork/doelly.', '2007-03-11 14:48:41.000000', NULL, 1),
