(3450517, 480235, 16197, '<td valign="top">bottle of apple juice?  This could be a really fun image, its an nice concept however for me, there are several deficiencies.  Some of those are not fixable within basic editing.  What if you shot this on glass with a light from underneath and a dark background?  Also put something up on the sites as to not get reflections, like sheets or posterboard (white)</td>', 'bottle of apple juice?  This could be a really fun image, its an nice concept however for me, there are several deficiencies.  Some of those are not fixable within basic editing.  What if you shot this on glass with a light from underneath and a dark background?  Also put something up on the sites as to not get reflections, like sheets or posterboard (white)', '2007-03-11 14:55:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450520, 479480, 16197, '<td valign="top">I like this concept, However, I don''t care for the invisible bottom of the tea pot.  I would have loved to see it sitting on something than the cup floating.</td>', 'I like this concept, However, I don''t care for the invisible bottom of the tea pot.  I would have loved to see it sitting on something than the cup floating.', '2007-03-11 14:56:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450529, 480293, 16197, '<td valign="top">The most interesting portion of this image, is the shadow casted by the light reflecting in the mirror on the bamboo plant.  Although my back aches wanting this treatment, I find the image flat.  I think maybe a face shot with some emotion would make a much dramatic appeal as well as a stronger angle and not from the perspective of someone standing there (feels snapshotish)  Bring the camera close and personal hard angle and adjust the levels/curves a bit for a more poppier image.</td>', 'The most interesting portion of this image, is the shadow casted by the light reflecting in the mirror on the bamboo plant.  Although my back aches wanting this treatment, I find the image flat.  I think maybe a face shot with some emotion would make a much dramatic appeal as well as a stronger angle and not from the perspective of someone standing there (feels snapshotish)  Bring the camera close and personal hard angle and adjust the levels/curves a bit for a more poppier image.', '2007-03-11 14:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450534, 480325, 16197, '<td valign="top">As much as I really enjoy these colours, I don''t care for the effect.  I like the idea and the angle/perspective, However, it feels blown out.  I am assuming you used a longer exposure because it was dark out and the light came from the tub itself.  I am curios though what a shorter exposure would do.  IS the figure to dark?   Maybe try again, but use a backlight and shorter exposure.</td>', 'As much as I really enjoy these colours, I don''t care for the effect.  I like the idea and the angle/perspective, However, it feels blown out.  I am assuming you used a longer exposure because it was dark out and the light came from the tub itself.  I am curios though what a shorter exposure would do.  IS the figure to dark?   Maybe try again, but use a backlight and shorter exposure.', '2007-03-11 15:00:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450539, 478899, 16197, '<td valign="top">ity bitty image hard to see, it is out of focus and not very appealing because of that.  The colours seem nice, but hard to tell.</td>', 'ity bitty image hard to see, it is out of focus and not very appealing because of that.  The colours seem nice, but hard to tell.', '2007-03-11 15:01:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450544, 480408, 16197, '<td valign="top">I like this concept, However, I think there needs to be sharper focus and more emphasis on the meridians. Also, I think the model should not be hunched over like they are, I would have liked to see a stronger straight model.</td>', 'I like this concept, However, I think there needs to be sharper focus and more emphasis on the meridians. Also, I think the model should not be hunched over like they are, I would have liked to see a stronger straight model.', '2007-03-11 15:02:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450548, 477375, 15358, '<td valign="top">this is a great idea,  the background is distracting,  needs to be simplified</td>', 'this is a great idea,  the background is distracting,  needs to be simplified', '2007-03-11 15:04:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450550, 478619, 16197, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, however it looks like a basketball in the back.  The image also seems a bit flat, the grays are just to much for me without much difference between them.  Thee spot in the back that is blown out a touch I am sure is murder when you try to adjust levels/curves.  Maybe though try to use more even lighting on the dish itself and less on the backdrop.</td>', 'Interesting idea, however it looks like a basketball in the back.  The image also seems a bit flat, the grays are just to much for me without much difference between them.  Thee spot in the back that is blown out a touch I am sure is murder when you try to adjust levels/curves.  Maybe though try to use more even lighting on the dish itself and less on the backdrop.', '2007-03-11 15:04:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450551, 480133, 15358, '<td valign="top">I like the colors, the candles.</td>', 'I like the colors, the candles.', '2007-03-11 15:04:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450553, 476991, 15358, '<td valign="top">size matters, also could be sharper</td>', 'size matters, also could be sharper', '2007-03-11 15:05:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450557, 480515, 16197, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy this image.  It seems to pulse as I look at it.  Very nicely captured.  There is a distracting element for me, But I can not quite put my finger on it, something about the Zuni Medicine Bear just isn''t right....</td>', 'I really enjoy this image.  It seems to pulse as I look at it.  Very nicely captured.  There is a distracting element for me, But I can not quite put my finger on it, something about the Zuni Medicine Bear just isn''t right....', '2007-03-11 15:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450559, 479580, 15358, '<td valign="top">well crafted shot, troubling but that is what you were shooting for,</td>', 'well crafted shot, troubling but that is what you were shooting for,', '2007-03-11 15:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450562, 478780, 16197, '<td valign="top">I like the reflection and such... well if there was a single reflection I would really like it, but someone there is three?  Also the black spot on the capsel is really distracting as is the wight spots in front of the package.  I would have liked to see a stronger graduant as well and maybe the package at a slight angle.</td>', 'I like the reflection and such... well if there was a single reflection I would really like it, but someone there is three?  Also the black spot on the capsel is really distracting as is the wight spots in front of the package.  I would have liked to see a stronger graduant as well and maybe the package at a slight angle.', '2007-03-11 15:08:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450563, 480042, 15358, '<td valign="top">sigh</td>', 'sigh', '2007-03-11 15:08:06.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(3450571, 479614, 16197, '<td valign="top">It is a nice shot, However, it does not hold much interest for me.  I understand the concept and meaning, but is not strong enough in my opinion.</td>', 'It is a nice shot, However, it does not hold much interest for me.  I understand the concept and meaning, but is not strong enough in my opinion.', '2007-03-11 15:10:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450572, 478523, 74664, '<td valign="top">At first I had no clue what was going on, now I see the person but I''m still not quite sure what to make of it.</td>', 'At first I had no clue what was going on, now I see the person but I''m still not quite sure what to make of it.', '2007-03-11 15:10:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450584, 479959, 16197, '<td valign="top">I really like everything in this image... except for all the catchlight reflections in/on the tea/cup.  This is very fantastic and if you cloned out those it would be perfect.  Very well done.</td>', 'I really like everything in this image... except for all the catchlight reflections in/on the tea/cup.  This is very fantastic and if you cloned out those it would be perfect.  Very well done.', '2007-03-11 15:15:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450589, 479955, 16197, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic image, I really enjoy it.  Now if you could have gotten your model to co-operate more to match the label I would have scored this a 10.  Very nicely done.</td>', 'This is a fantastic image, I really enjoy it.  Now if you could have gotten your model to co-operate more to match the label I would have scored this a 10.  Very nicely done.', '2007-03-11 15:16:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450596, 478980, 16197, '<td valign="top">I like this idea kinda, However, it just seems really out of focus for me.  Not sure exactly if it is the shear number, or if they are a bit oof.  I think this would be better with a bit of colour balancing to make the bees pop more and a bit contrast.</td>', 'I like this idea kinda, However, it just seems really out of focus for me.  Not sure exactly if it is the shear number, or if they are a bit oof.  I think this would be better with a bit of colour balancing to make the bees pop more and a bit contrast.', '2007-03-11 15:18:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450604, 479981, 16197, '<td valign="top">This concept has possibilities.  If it had the light source more in the center and created a much more blanced image I think this would go far.  However as it is, it is very distracting because the lack of balance with distances, lighting, and reflections.</td>', 'This concept has possibilities.  If it had the light source more in the center and created a much more blanced image I think this would go far.  However as it is, it is very distracting because the lack of balance with distances, lighting, and reflections.', '2007-03-11 15:21:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450610, 480488, 16197, '<td valign="top">This is an ok image.  I would have really liked to see the smoke more in focus, and more even lighting on the container.</td>', 'This is an ok image.  I would have really liked to see the smoke more in focus, and more even lighting on the container.', '2007-03-11 15:22:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450614, 479563, 16197, '<td valign="top">This is a fun image, but I really don''t care for the tubes of stuff and maybe if the cup was more focus around the herbs it would be a stronger image.  I really like the herbs, but the others distract.</td>', 'This is a fun image, but I really don''t care for the tubes of stuff and maybe if the cup was more focus around the herbs it would be a stronger image.  I really like the herbs, but the others distract.', '2007-03-11 15:24:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450649, 479902, 26633, '<td valign="top">Snake oil for the soul? Nice idea :)</td>', 'Snake oil for the soul? Nice idea :)', '2007-03-11 15:46:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450657, 480056, 16197, '<td valign="top">I like the concept here, Although there is just something that throws me with the image. moreso with the cloth the stone is sitting on, something about the colours just isn''t right.  Also that light spot in the stone drawls my eye in like a vortex.</td>', 'I like the concept here, Although there is just something that throws me with the image. moreso with the cloth the stone is sitting on, something about the colours just isn''t right.  Also that light spot in the stone drawls my eye in like a vortex.', '2007-03-11 15:51:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450658, 480191, 16197, '<td valign="top">Ok it seems I can see water through the trees, You have a great area around and yet you chose this area.  Personally I would have taken them to the beach and captured the water behind them.  Also, minus the extra items around them they are very distracting.</td>', 'Ok it seems I can see water through the trees, You have a great area around and yet you chose this area.  Personally I would have taken them to the beach and captured the water behind them.  Also, minus the extra items around them they are very distracting.', '2007-03-11 15:54:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450665, 476991, 62095, '<td valign="top">I don''t think it''s really clear enough what is in the microwave.</td>', 'I don''t think it''s really clear enough what is in the microwave.', '2007-03-11 15:58:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450666, 480109, 62095, '<td valign="top">Good shot. Bit of a tenuous link to the challenge I think.</td>', 'Good shot. Bit of a tenuous link to the challenge I think.', '2007-03-11 15:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450668, 479981, 62095, '<td valign="top">Great quality of light reflected onto the flooring.  The onyl thing that annoys me about this shot and prevents a really high score from me is the object to the top right side.  I think I''d crop that out.</td>', 'Great quality of light reflected onto the flooring.  The onyl thing that annoys me about this shot and prevents a really high score from me is the object to the top right side.  I think I''d crop that out.', '2007-03-11 16:00:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450669, 480203, 62095, '<td valign="top">Try to make your image larger so we can see more.</td>', 'Try to make your image larger so we can see more.', '2007-03-11 16:01:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450672, 478899, 62095, '<td valign="top">I think this is possibly the smallest photo that I have ever seen on here.  Try to submit larger photos so we can actually see them.</td>', 'I think this is possibly the smallest photo that I have ever seen on here.  Try to submit larger photos so we can actually see them.', '2007-03-11 16:03:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450673, 480328, 16197, '<td valign="top">That would have tickled me like crazy.  I like the concept and I think the DOF is nice.  I would have liked cleaner lines but that is just being too picky L()L.  Nice image.</td>', 'That would have tickled me like crazy.  I like the concept and I think the DOF is nice.  I would have liked cleaner lines but that is just being too picky L()L.  Nice image.', '2007-03-11 16:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450675, 477630, 16197, '<td valign="top">this is a fantastic image.  I really im drawn in by several different elements of this.  Very well done.</td>', 'this is a fantastic image.  I really im drawn in by several different elements of this.  Very well done.', '2007-03-11 16:05:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450678, 480175, 62095, '<td valign="top">Good use of colours.</td>', 'Good use of colours.', '2007-03-11 16:06:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450679, 479974, 16197, '<td valign="top">This is a fairly nice image. But, for me, I would have really love to see it cropped down as to not see the rocks/ledge on the left and have it feel more Open for her.  I think if the left was cropped out this image could possible ribbon. Very nicely done.</td>', 'This is a fairly nice image. But, for me, I would have really love to see it cropped down as to not see the rocks/ledge on the left and have it feel more Open for her.  I think if the left was cropped out this image could possible ribbon. Very nicely done.', '2007-03-11 16:06:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450680, 479984, 16197, '<td valign="top">Interesting image, not really sure how to take this one.  It feels just like a snap shot and doesn''t give me really a ton of feeling.  Just some guy drinking.</td>', 'Interesting image, not really sure how to take this one.  It feels just like a snap shot and doesn''t give me really a ton of feeling.  Just some guy drinking.', '2007-03-11 16:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450683, 480195, 16197, '<td valign="top">I like the fact Miles Davis is sticking out a bit more than the others.  I really like this concept and stuff, However, I also would have liked to see that this was a medicine chest moreso.  A bit of levels adjustment as well might help pop the image a touch more.</td>', 'I like the fact Miles Davis is sticking out a bit more than the others.  I really like this concept and stuff, However, I also would have liked to see that this was a medicine chest moreso.  A bit of levels adjustment as well might help pop the image a touch more.', '2007-03-11 16:09:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450689, 480298, 16197, '<td valign="top">This is a great concept.  I would have liked a more even lighting on the ston, but I really like how this turned out.  Maybe a bit more contrast between the background and model as well, but overall a really nice image.</td>', 'This is a great concept.  I would have liked a more even lighting on the ston, but I really like how this turned out.  Maybe a bit more contrast between the background and model as well, but overall a really nice image.', '2007-03-11 16:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450690, 480294, 16197, '<td valign="top">This is a very clean shot.  Everything appears to be lit well and balanced.  To be picky, the scratches and red mark on the table is very noticeable.  A very nice image all the same.</td>', 'This is a very clean shot.  Everything appears to be lit well and balanced.  To be picky, the scratches and red mark on the table is very noticeable.  A very nice image all the same.', '2007-03-11 16:16:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450691, 480503, 16197, '<td valign="top">I like this concept.  However I think maybe a tighter shot would have been more effective as well as a small light aimed into the face a bit.  Which could have been hidden behind the bowl or the box.  Nice idea overall.</td>', 'I like this concept.  However I think maybe a tighter shot would have been more effective as well as a small light aimed into the face a bit.  Which could have been hidden behind the bowl or the box.  Nice idea overall.', '2007-03-11 16:17:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450694, 479050, 16197, '<td valign="top">This is a really fun idea.  The light spot on the kettle caught my eye right away, would have liked it more balanced.  I see a few droplets flying out. Wonder if it may have been possible to generate a larger size or amount?  I really love this set though.  You get extra point just for the beauty of the tea set.</td>', 'This is a really fun idea.  The light spot on the kettle caught my eye right away, would have liked it more balanced.  I see a few droplets flying out. Wonder if it may have been possible to generate a larger size or amount?  I really love this set though.  You get extra point just for the beauty of the tea set.', '2007-03-11 16:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450696, 479204, 16197, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, However, it seems very flat and the dof also seems a bit shallow.  I think I would have liked a strong contrast here.</td>', 'Interesting idea, However, it seems very flat and the dof also seems a bit shallow.  I think I would have liked a strong contrast here.', '2007-03-11 16:19:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450699, 478696, 16197, '<td valign="top">This is very cute idea, and very well done.  I am curious to what this may look like with a more shallow dof.  On the plan of the may cause dizziness? Hmm, Very nice.</td>', 'This is very cute idea, and very well done.  I am curious to what this may look like with a more shallow dof.  On the plan of the may cause dizziness? Hmm, Very nice.', '2007-03-11 16:21:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450701, 480010, 16197, '<td valign="top">That is some ruff drinking there.  I like the concept of this, but Don''t care for the angle or how the grass in the grinder blends into the grass in the tray.  I think maybe a stronger angle or even head on, with the tray at an angle so it does not blend with each other.</td>', 'That is some ruff drinking there.  I like the concept of this, but Don''t care for the angle or how the grass in the grinder blends into the grass in the tray.  I think maybe a stronger angle or even head on, with the tray at an angle so it does not blend with each other.', '2007-03-11 16:22:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450706, 479156, 16197, '<td valign="top">Nice Idea, but the bite would have been nicer if it was the traditional half circle.  Also, by cutting corners it distracts from the overall image.  Lastly, I think the whole bar should be raised and not at an angle. it would have given a stronger feel.  Other than that, Everything looks nice, very nicely captured.</td>', 'Nice Idea, but the bite would have been nicer if it was the traditional half circle.  Also, by cutting corners it distracts from the overall image.  Lastly, I think the whole bar should be raised and not at an angle. it would have given a stronger feel.  Other than that, Everything looks nice, very nicely captured.', '2007-03-11 16:25:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450710, 479970, 16197, '<td valign="top">This is a cute image.  I like how you used the needles inside looks very fun.  The bowl in the back is distracting, it makes me feel like I am missing something.  Also, it seems there is a bit too much white reflecting, it creates this haze for me.  Over all a very nice image.</td>', 'This is a cute image.  I like how you used the needles inside looks very fun.  The bowl in the back is distracting, it makes me feel like I am missing something.  Also, it seems there is a bit too much white reflecting, it creates this haze for me.  Over all a very nice image.', '2007-03-11 16:27:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450712, 476991, 16197, '<td valign="top">Very small image, I like the concept but the flash marks small size and blur really ruin this great idea for me.</td>', 'Very small image, I like the concept but the flash marks small size and blur really ruin this great idea for me.', '2007-03-11 16:28:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450715, 479287, 16197, '<td valign="top">That is a cute puppy, however for me the focus seems a bit soft.  I like the idea, just a bit soft for me.  Also a touch more contrast would be nice.</td>', 'That is a cute puppy, however for me the focus seems a bit soft.  I like the idea, just a bit soft for me.  Also a touch more contrast would be nice.', '2007-03-11 16:29:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450718, 479209, 16197, '<td valign="top">Ok, I almost understand this idea.  There is several ways people have come up with to pull teeth.  However, the blurred out of focus motion blured image is not very appealing.  It does not tell me a clear story or idea.</td>', 'Ok, I almost understand this idea.  There is several ways people have come up with to pull teeth.  However, the blurred out of focus motion blured image is not very appealing.  It does not tell me a clear story or idea.', '2007-03-11 16:31:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450721, 480468, 16197, '<td valign="top">I think your idea was in the right place however your camera wasn''t.  For me, to show a Herb Shop, It would have been fantastic to have rows of herbs we can see more clearly instead of a wall of drawers.</td>', 'I think your idea was in the right place however your camera wasn''t.  For me, to show a Herb Shop, It would have been fantastic to have rows of herbs we can see more clearly instead of a wall of drawers.', '2007-03-11 16:32:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450724, 479931, 16197, '<td valign="top">Cute image, very nicely captured, However, I don''t think I care so much for the blue colour.  But very nice all the same.</td>', 'Cute image, very nicely captured, However, I don''t think I care so much for the blue colour.  But very nice all the same.', '2007-03-11 16:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450725, 479187, 16197, '<td valign="top">This is a really fun idea. I injoy the creativity of it.  However, I would have liked to maybe see an E or two through the pills a tad better, and the side by side lights are distracting for me.  (Long bar small square)  Very nice image.</td>', 'This is a really fun idea. I injoy the creativity of it.  However, I would have liked to maybe see an E or two through the pills a tad better, and the side by side lights are distracting for me.  (Long bar small square)  Very nice image.', '2007-03-11 16:35:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450735, 480220, 16197, '<td valign="top">I really like this image, except for the light spot inside the cup. It is distracting.  But the other elements of this image are very strong for me.  Very nicely done.</td>', 'I really like this image, except for the light spot inside the cup. It is distracting.  But the other elements of this image are very strong for me.  Very nicely done.', '2007-03-11 16:48:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450736, 480325, 60121, '<td valign="top">Nice Lighting and steam adds a great effect.</td>', 'Nice Lighting and steam adds a great effect.', '2007-03-11 16:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450737, 480101, 16197, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on this challenge.  It seems to be a very fun image and might have been slightly difficult to capture, unless you are a twin that is.  This is a very fun concept.</td>', 'Interesting take on this challenge.  It seems to be a very fun image and might have been slightly difficult to capture, unless you are a twin that is.  This is a very fun concept.', '2007-03-11 16:49:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450738, 478851, 75051, '<td valign="top">Good lighting, love the lipstick and GREAT LAMP!</td>', 'Good lighting, love the lipstick and GREAT LAMP!', '2007-03-11 16:49:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450741, 480151, 16197, '<td valign="top">This is a fantastic image.  Gives me the feeling he is sitting in an old military tent, and is supposed to do something that only the military would allow L()L.  Very nice editing on this shot the models expression tells it all very nice.</td>', 'This is a fantastic image.  Gives me the feeling he is sitting in an old military tent, and is supposed to do something that only the military would allow L()L.  Very nice editing on this shot the models expression tells it all very nice.', '2007-03-11 16:50:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450744, 480270, 16197, '<td valign="top">I like the concept of this shot, but it looks over digital to me, the lines are choppy.  Sadly as well the sky is hazy. I bet this is overwhelming on a clear day.  Really enjoy this concept/view.</td>', 'I like the concept of this shot, but it looks over digital to me, the lines are choppy.  Sadly as well the sky is hazy. I bet this is overwhelming on a clear day.  Really enjoy this concept/view.', '2007-03-11 16:51:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450746, 479680, 60121, '<td valign="top">The Contrast and DOF are great.</td>', 'The Contrast and DOF are great.', '2007-03-11 16:53:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450750, 477945, 60121, '<td valign="top">Very Nice Lighting especially the back light to illuminate the blue backdrop.</td>', 'Very Nice Lighting especially the back light to illuminate the blue backdrop.', '2007-03-11 16:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450769, 478899, 60121, '<td valign="top">Great color contrast and nice subject matter, although the photo is way to small to even judge and the whole thing is out of focus.</td>', 'Great color contrast and nice subject matter, although the photo is way to small to even judge and the whole thing is out of focus.', '2007-03-11 17:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450802, 479931, 22748, '<td valign="top">Very smooth and clean look to this image! I like it. A simple (uncluttered) and effective image. The monochrome/duotone look is great.</td>', 'Very smooth and clean look to this image! I like it. A simple (uncluttered) and effective image. The monochrome/duotone look is great.', '2007-03-11 17:29:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(3450804, 478985, 22748, '<td valign="top">Awesome lighting! The blinding light from the sky is used as backlighting to a great effect, but you also have perfect exposure on the foreground, particularly the facing wall of the church where the detail is very good.</td>', 'Awesome lighting! The blinding light from the sky is used as backlighting to a great effect, but you also have perfect exposure on the foreground, particularly the facing wall of the church where the detail is very good.', '2007-03-11 17:31:07.000000', NULL, 1),
