(3451040, 478851, 30490, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but, yeah you knew a but was coming.... the image is on the small side which isn''t helping you, and your light and dark contrasts are too extreme.  The wine and the bottle are so dark and the lamp is so white and bright.  It makes it hard to find a happy medium in the photo.  Your concept is good and the staging is nice though.  Keep trying and better luck next time.</td>', 'Good idea, but, yeah you knew a but was coming.... the image is on the small side which isn''t helping you, and your light and dark contrasts are too extreme.  The wine and the bottle are so dark and the lamp is so white and bright.  It makes it hard to find a happy medium in the photo.  Your concept is good and the staging is nice though.  Keep trying and better luck next time.', '2007-03-11 20:22:24.000000', NULL, 1),
