(3451047, 480203, 30490, '<td valign="top">Overall not a bad photo, just too small to do it justice.  Take a look at the excellent tutorial on preparing photos for contests in the learning section here on DPC.  That helped me a lot!  I can''t get to detailed in my critique because I can''t see the details in the image...  Keep trying and working on your photography though, don''t get discouraged.  There is a lot to learn here on this web site and some great people to learn it from!</td>', 'Overall not a bad photo, just too small to do it justice.  Take a look at the excellent tutorial on preparing photos for contests in the learning section here on DPC.  That helped me a lot!  I can''t get to detailed in my critique because I can''t see the details in the image...  Keep trying and working on your photography though, don''t get discouraged.  There is a lot to learn here on this web site and some great people to learn it from!', '2007-03-11 20:24:26.000000', NULL, 1),
