(3451156, 479580, 30490, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you received a bunch of does not meet challenge comments - this is another one....  Alternative medicine still follows the premise of "do no harm" obviously what you are portraying isn''t following that creed.  As for the photo, it is gritty and harsh and definately captures the awful side of drug use.</td>', 'I''m sure you received a bunch of does not meet challenge comments - this is another one....  Alternative medicine still follows the premise of "do no harm" obviously what you are portraying isn''t following that creed.  As for the photo, it is gritty and harsh and definately captures the awful side of drug use.', '2007-03-11 21:15:43.000000', NULL, 1),
