(3451158, 478523, 16197, '<td valign="top">I had one of those many many moons ago.  It took me a second to figure out what is going on here, notice the hacksaw and all.  Its a fun idea, but Personally I don''t think it works well.  I think the sheet really flattens everything out to much and you lose the horror type appeal this image should carry.  Maybe try it with higher contrasts and should work out better for ya.</td>', 'I had one of those many many moons ago.  It took me a second to figure out what is going on here, notice the hacksaw and all.  Its a fun idea, but Personally I don''t think it works well.  I think the sheet really flattens everything out to much and you lose the horror type appeal this image should carry.  Maybe try it with higher contrasts and should work out better for ya.', '2007-03-11 21:17:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(3451159, 480235, 30490, '<td valign="top">Nice reflection, and interesting image, but it just doesn''t seem to be on topic in my opinion.  I don''t think that anyone would consider alcohol alternative medicine in a positive way, and that is how I have viewed this challenge.</td>', 'Nice reflection, and interesting image, but it just doesn''t seem to be on topic in my opinion.  I don''t think that anyone would consider alcohol alternative medicine in a positive way, and that is how I have viewed this challenge.', '2007-03-11 21:18:09.000000', NULL, 1),
