(3451175, 479874, 16197, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy the concept here, and the colours are nice.  But a couple things distract me.  Her hands being off center, her posture seems to be hunched over to much, and the transparency of her dress. Seeing her leg/calfs is distracting I think it really throws the image.and the horizontal is tilted from knee to knee.  I think if these few things are cleaned up straighted up you would have a really nice image.  Maybe also get rid of the white thing on the lower right side of the image as you are looking at it.</td>', 'I really enjoy the concept here, and the colours are nice.  But a couple things distract me.  Her hands being off center, her posture seems to be hunched over to much, and the transparency of her dress. Seeing her leg/calfs is distracting I think it really throws the image.and the horizontal is tilted from knee to knee.  I think if these few things are cleaned up straighted up you would have a really nice image.  Maybe also get rid of the white thing on the lower right side of the image as you are looking at it.', '2007-03-11 21:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
