(3451378, 480401, 16197, '<td valign="top">Looks very fun, but not sure why you keep the smoky quartz in there.  I know it likes it cool and dark, but also doesn''t stay will with the pyrite.   Over all its a fairly fun image.</td>', 'Looks very fun, but not sure why you keep the smoky quartz in there.  I know it likes it cool and dark, but also doesn''t stay will with the pyrite.   Over all its a fairly fun image.', '2007-03-11 22:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(3451382, 479828, 16197, '<td valign="top">Now thats a Prickly Pear.  I really enjoy the design you made here.  The spiral really creates more intrest.  However, that spot distracts.  I also think a wider dof to where the whole pear is in focus would have been nice and allow the background to fade.  Missing the tip of the stem distracts me.</td>', 'Now thats a Prickly Pear.  I really enjoy the design you made here.  The spiral really creates more intrest.  However, that spot distracts.  I also think a wider dof to where the whole pear is in focus would have been nice and allow the background to fade.  Missing the tip of the stem distracts me.', '2007-03-11 22:43:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(3451385, 479989, 16197, '<td valign="top">The flash on here really destroyers the image, also having everything dead center really lessens the appeal.</td>', 'The flash on here really destroyers the image, also having everything dead center really lessens the appeal.', '2007-03-11 22:44:55.000000', NULL, 1),
