(3458143, 477644, 71105, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everyone for their great comments.  It''s really amazing to see how many people leave the same constructive criticism without seeing each others'' comments.  that''s how I know everyone must be right!  In this case, many people, as you can see below, wanted to see my wife''s entire torso.  I took many shots of her, and unfortunately the ones with her whole body showing also showed umbrellas and people in a pool that you can''t see from this angle.  So, while I agree it would have been great to have her up higher, I had to settle for this shot.  But I was extrememly happy with it, and thrilled about a top 10 finish!  Thanks again.</td>', 'Thanks to everyone for their great comments.  It''s really amazing to see how many people leave the same constructive criticism without seeing each others'' comments.  that''s how I know everyone must be right!  In this case, many people, as you can see below, wanted to see my wife''s entire torso.  I took many shots of her, and unfortunately the ones with her whole body showing also showed umbrellas and people in a pool that you can''t see from this angle.  So, while I agree it would have been great to have her up higher, I had to settle for this shot.  But I was extrememly happy with it, and thrilled about a top 10 finish!  Thanks again.', '2007-03-14 00:48:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(3458158, 479480, 73725, '<td valign="top">Thanks to everyone for your comments!  I really feel like I can take a few things from the input and apply them to future shots.  I''m thrilled to have so many talented photographers (and viewers, alike!) take the time to look at my work.  I was a bit surprised, however, that some people didn''t get how the shot fit into the theme. (?)  Herbal remedies, particularly teas, are a major part of alternative medicine.  Oh well.  :)</td>', 'Thanks to everyone for your comments!  I really feel like I can take a few things from the input and apply them to future shots.  I''m thrilled to have so many talented photographers (and viewers, alike!) take the time to look at my work.  I was a bit surprised, however, that some people didn''t get how the shot fit into the theme. (?)  Herbal remedies, particularly teas, are a major part of alternative medicine.  Oh well.  :)', '2007-03-14 00:51:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(3458173, 480233, 15711, '<td valign="top">Great job.  Fantastic win.</td>', 'Great job.  Fantastic win.', '2007-03-14 00:55:45.000000', NULL, 0),
(3458234, 477644, 66635, '<td valign="top">Congrats Chris!</td>', 'Congrats Chris!', '2007-03-14 01:05:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(3458245, 479955, 63503, '<td valign="top">Thank you all for the comments and votes. For those that asked, no, it is not my snake, I had to rent it from a kid that works in pet shop. I had never handled a snake before, it ended up being fun. I am told this is a ''ball python'' named so because it curls itself into a ball when threatened (which we confirmed). We kept the snake in our home for 2 days, we did not have to feed it as the owner had just fed it a mouse the day before we got it, in fact, you can actually see the mouse lump inside the snake in the section wrapping around the neck of the bottle. Thank you again.</td>', 'Thank you all for the comments and votes. For those that asked, no, it is not my snake, I had to rent it from a kid that works in pet shop. I had never handled a snake before, it ended up being fun. I am told this is a ''ball python'' named so because it curls itself into a ball when threatened (which we confirmed). We kept the snake in our home for 2 days, we did not have to feed it as the owner had just fed it a mouse the day before we got it, in fact, you can actually see the mouse lump inside the snake in the section wrapping around the neck of the bottle. Thank you again.', '2007-03-14 01:07:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(3458271, 479974, 60915, '<td valign="top">Dude! Nice top ten finish! Well done!</td>', 'Dude! Nice top ten finish! Well done!', '2007-03-14 01:13:35.000000', NULL, 0),
(3458291, 479580, 66635, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by CBalck:</b></div><hr/><i> I''m sure you received a bunch of does not meet challenge comments - this is another one....  Alternative medicine still follows the premise of "do no harm" obviously what you are portraying isn''t following that creed.  As for the photo, it is gritty and harsh and definately captures the awful side of drug use. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>I think the above comment is a ridiculously strict (and politically-motivated) interpretation of the challenge.  The term "alternative medicine" leaves very wide room for interpretation -- including doing things that harm you.  For an addict, or for a person with emotional trauma of some sort, shooting up may very well seem like medicine for what ails him because it gives him the relief he seeks -- albeit at a cost.  And, for someone like me, the term "alternative medicine" conjurs up visions of snake oil merchants and flaky quacks.</td>', 'Originally posted by CBalck: I''m sure you received a bunch of does not meet challenge comments - this is another one....  Alternative medicine still follows the premise of "do no harm" obviously what you are portraying isn''t following that creed.  As for the photo, it is gritty and harsh and definately captures the awful side of drug use.   I think the above comment is a ridiculously strict (and politically-motivated) interpretation of the challenge.  The term "alternative medicine" leaves very wide room for interpretation -- including doing things that harm you.  For an addict, or for a person with emotional trauma of some sort, shooting up may very well seem like medicine for what ails him because it gives him the relief he seeks -- albeit at a cost.  And, for someone like me, the term "alternative medicine" conjurs up visions of snake oil merchants and flaky quacks.', '2007-03-14 01:19:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(3458311, 479050, 65025, '<td valign="top">Great placement, and nice shot!</td>', 'Great placement, and nice shot!', '2007-03-14 01:23:33.000000', NULL, 0),
