(3458386, 480272, 67612, '<td valign="top">I didn''t write sex on my hand.  I received the stamp from Club La Vela in Panama City, Florida.  It is the country''s largest night club.  I thought it would make an interesting picture.  After some PP, I decided to enter it into the challenge, but I didn''t think it would get as many negative comments as it did.</td>', 'I didn''t write sex on my hand.  I received the stamp from Club La Vela in Panama City, Florida.  It is the country''s largest night club.  I thought it would make an interesting picture.  After some PP, I decided to enter it into the challenge, but I didn''t think it would get as many negative comments as it did.', '2007-03-14 01:44:10.000000', NULL, 0),
