(3458407, 479731, 53316, '<td valign="top">Wow, I like this photo.  I''m assuming that the operations having ended means she is okay? I''ve always admired people with the strength to share with the world a picture of themselves with scars.  It always speaks to me of a beauty that surpasses and transcends anything that could be scarred.</td>', 'Wow, I like this photo.  I''m assuming that the operations having ended means she is okay? I''ve always admired people with the strength to share with the world a picture of themselves with scars.  It always speaks to me of a beauty that surpasses and transcends anything that could be scarred.', '2007-03-14 01:50:23.000000', NULL, 0),
