(3458694, 480233, 10702, '<td valign="top">Are you guys freaking kidding me !!!<br/> <br/>I went through this week submission and decided that I didn''t stand a chance, like usually. I saw a bunch of really good work<br/> <br/>I see in the comments that many of you like it mostly because of the idea, as I said in the description the idea came from a friend of mine, Russi (Rúnar Ninja) which asked me to bring the tool to the studio. He decided to participate in the Red challenge in stead and gave the chance of using his idea.<br/> <br/>This ( //farm1.static.flickr.com/184/413091794_afd607f253_o.jpg ) would have been my other entry for the challenge, as you all can see, a pretty dull idea.<br/> <br/>So HUUUUGE thanks to him, again.<br/> <br/>And so many hugs and kisses to you. Haven''t done anything nice on this site for years and this is clearly what I need to be motivated for few more !<br/> <br/>Im going out celebrating !<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2007-03-14 18:15:14.</i></td>', 'Are you guys freaking kidding me !!! I went through this week submission and decided that I didn''t stand a chance, like usually. I saw a bunch of really good work I see in the comments that many of you like it mostly because of the idea, as I said in the description the idea came from a friend of mine, Russi (Rúnar Ninja) which asked me to bring the tool to the studio. He decided to participate in the Red challenge in stead and gave the chance of using his idea. This ( //farm1.static.flickr.com/184/413091794_afd607f253_o.jpg ) would have been my other entry for the challenge, as you all can see, a pretty dull idea. So HUUUUGE thanks to him, again. And so many hugs and kisses to you. Haven''t done anything nice on this site for years and this is clearly what I need to be motivated for few more ! Im going out celebrating !', '2007-03-14 04:39:17.000000', '2007-03-14 18:15:14.000000', 0),
