(3459643, 480280, 26045, '<td valign="top">thanks for the comments, all.<br/> <br/>i do find it strange that so many people think alternative medicine has a single definition! <br/> <br/>i could bang a hammer on my skull, but if it treats my headache...alternative medicine! and, people, there IS such a thing as:<br/> <br/>ART THERAPY<br/> <br/>mmmhmmm.<br/>blargh. <br/> <br/>that includes music therapy, writing therapy, photo therapy, mmhmmm. and more, too. <br/> <br/>whatev, i didn''t even try to take a photo for this challenge. <br/> <br/>this one was taken at coney island, from the boardwalk, zoomed hella far at some dude on the shore. i felt it fit the challenge ok enough to enter it. but i didn''t really care.<br/> <br/>cheers to that,<br/>katy<br/></td>', 'thanks for the comments, all. i do find it strange that so many people think alternative medicine has a single definition!  i could bang a hammer on my skull, but if it treats my headache...alternative medicine! and, people, there IS such a thing as: ART THERAPY mmmhmmm.blargh.  that includes music therapy, writing therapy, photo therapy, mmhmmm. and more, too.  whatev, i didn''t even try to take a photo for this challenge.  this one was taken at coney island, from the boardwalk, zoomed hella far at some dude on the shore. i felt it fit the challenge ok enough to enter it. but i didn''t really care. cheers to that,katy', '2007-03-14 09:47:07.000000', NULL, 0),
