(3937024, 479050, 14986, '<td valign="top">Hmm...apparently I would be in the minority for this one.<br/> <br/>I don''t really care for the set up or the lighting.  The glare on the cups is distracting to me.  The few little droplets in the air also don''t seem to add anything worthwhile to the shot.  The black border seems a bit heavy.   Perhaps a different color background would add a little more interest for me.  <br/> <br/>Mostly, I just think the idea doesn''t really catch my interest.  <br/> <br/>That being said....I am obviously in the minority!  :)</td>', 'Hmm...apparently I would be in the minority for this one. I don''t really care for the set up or the lighting.  The glare on the cups is distracting to me.  The few little droplets in the air also don''t seem to add anything worthwhile to the shot.  The black border seems a bit heavy.   Perhaps a different color background would add a little more interest for me.   Mostly, I just think the idea doesn''t really catch my interest.   That being said....I am obviously in the minority!  :)', '2007-07-25 18:43:06.000000', NULL, 0),
