(4577021, 480445, 91576, '<td valign="top">I love it!  I love the way you chose the colors and they way you used the light.  The face at the top kind of lost in background gives it a magicla effect.  Great job!<br/> <br/>It reminds me a little bit about a pic that I took in India... check out the link.. (I also have it on my portfolio)<br/> <br/>//web.mac.com/daklein/iWeb/David%20Klein/India%20-%20Nepal_files/169.jpg<br/> <br/>Great photos!<br/> <br/>D</td>', 'I love it!  I love the way you chose the colors and they way you used the light.  The face at the top kind of lost in background gives it a magicla effect.  Great job! It reminds me a little bit about a pic that I took in India... check out the link.. (I also have it on my portfolio) //web.mac.com/daklein/iWeb/David%20Klein/India%20-%20Nepal_files/169.jpg Great photos! D', '2008-03-20 14:04:02.000000', NULL, 0),
